## Locked items look like any other item on every Minecade server: vanilla's lock lines under an
## item's name (the hotbar's "Can't Move Items can't be: moved, dropped, removed, crafted with",
## "This item is not lost on death", and the same in the inventory's hover text) are a reset code,
## which draws nothing. An empty value doesn't take: the client kept vanilla's text. The hotbar
## popup also shows only its first line (ui/hud_screen.json). The lock corner and "Can't move item"
## are hidden too (textures/ui, ui/ui_common.json). en_GB.lang is the same file.
item.itemLock.cantDrop=§r
item.itemLock.cantMove=§r
item.itemLock.hoverText.cantBe.moved=§r
item.itemLock.hoverText.cantBe.dropped=§r
item.itemLock.hoverText.cantBe.removed=§r
item.itemLock.hoverText.cantBe.craftedWith=§r
item.itemLock.keepOnDeath=§r
item.itemLock.popupNotice.cantDrop=§r
item.itemLock.popupNotice.cantMove=§r
